

Programma opromje.


>> Veggy := Objekt nĳ.
Veggy by: ['nĳ'] dwaan: {
	>> v := sels nĳ.
	v init. <- v.
}.

Veggy by: ['init'] dwaan: { eigen veggies := 0. }.

Veggy by: ['carrots:'] dwaan: { :a eigen veggies := a. <- Neat. }.
Veggy by: ['carrots'] dwaan: { <- eigen veggies. }.
Veggy by: ['+'] dwaan: { :f
	>> n := Veggy nĳ.
	n carrots: (f carrots + eigen veggies). <- n.
}.

Veggy by: ['tekst'] dwaan: { <- eigen veggies tekst.
}.

Getal by: ['carrots'] dwaan: {
	>> x := Veggy nĳ.
	x carrots: sels. <- x.
}.

Getal by: ['add:and:'] dwaan: { :a :b <- (a + b).
}.

>> q := 0 add: (3 carrots + 2 carrots) and: 4 carrots.
Utfier skriuwe: q, nije-rigel.
